---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import mvpProcess from "@/images/mvp-process.png";
import MeetJosh from "@/components/MeetJosh.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="mvp development"
  description="fractional engineering leader focusing on accelerating delivery, not cost">
  <div
    class="flex flex-col px-4 space-y-16 sm:space-y-32 items-center lg:pt-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl w-full px-4 lg:p-8 space-y-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold">
        MVP development without the hassle
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-xl">
        You bring the idea. I bring the tech chops.
        <br />
        Nobody brings the headache and cost from outsourcing agencies.
      </p>
      <div class="flex">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="rounded-md bg-orange-500 px-8 py-4 lg:py-3.5 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-50 shadow-xs hover:bg-orange-400 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-orange-500">
          Get started
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="-mx-4">
      <div
        class="relative isolate overflow-hidden px-4 lg:p-8 space-y-8 lg:overflow-visible lg:px-0 border-t-1 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="absolute top-0 left-[max(50%,25rem)] h-256 w-512 -translate-x-1/2 mask-[radial-gradient(64rem_64rem_at_top,white,transparent)] stroke-gray-200 dark:stroke-gray-800">
            <defs>
              <pattern
                x="50%"
                y={-1}
                id="e813992c-7d03-4cc4-a2bd-151760b470a0"
                width={200}
                height={200}
                patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M100 200V.5M.5 .5H200" fill="none"></path>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <svg
              x="50%"
              y="-1"
              class="overflow-visible fill-gray-50 dark:fill-gray-800/50">
              <path
                d="M-100.5 0h201v201h-201Z M699.5 0h201v201h-201Z M499.5 400h201v201h-201Z M-300.5 600h201v201h-201Z"
                stroke-width="0"></path>
            </svg>
            <rect
              fill="url(#e813992c-7d03-4cc4-a2bd-151760b470a0)"
              width="100%"
              height="100%"
              stroke-width="0"></rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-y-10">
          <div
            class="lg:col-span-2 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1 lg:mx-auto lg:grid lg:w-full lg:max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-8 lg:px-8">
            <div class="lg:pr-4">
              <div class="lg:max-w-lg">
                <h1
                  class="mt-16 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-white">
                  Proven MVP approach
                </h1>
                <p class="mt-8 text-xl/8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                  A fast, design-led process that gets usable software in front
                  of real customers quickly—without wasting cycles on the wrong
                  thing.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="-mt-8 -ml-8 p-8 lg:sticky lg:top-4 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:overflow-hidden">
            <Picture
              src={mvpProcess}
              alt="MVP Development Process"
              formats={["avif", "webp"]}
              class="w-3xl max-w-none rounded-xl bg-gray-900 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-gray-400/10 sm:w-200 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:ring-white/10"
            />
          </div>
          <div
            class="lg:col-span-2 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:mx-auto lg:grid lg:w-full lg:max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-8 lg:px-8">
            <div class="lg:pr-4">
              <p>Here’s how we move from idea to working product fast:</p>
              <div
                class="max-w-xl text-base/7 text-gray-600 lg:max-w-lg dark:text-gray-400">
                <ul
                  role="list"
                  class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                  <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                    <span
                      aria-hidden="true"
                      class="mt-1 size-5 flex-none text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
                      🧭
                    </span>
                    <span>
                      <strong
                        class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                        >User flow design (IBM Design Thinking)</strong
                      > Map personas, needs, and flows using IBM’s Design Thinking
                      to align the team on outcomes and success metrics before a
                      single line of code is written.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                    <span
                      aria-hidden="true"
                      class="mt-1 size-5 flex-none text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
                      ✏️
                    </span>
                    <span>
                      <strong
                        class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                        >Low‑fidelity mockups</strong
                      > Create simple sketches and click-through wireframes to validate
                      flows quickly and reduce rework, keeping fidelity low so we
                      can iterate fast.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                    <span
                      aria-hidden="true"
                      class="mt-1 size-5 flex-none text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
                      🔁
                    </span>
                    <span>
                      <strong
                        class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                        >Short, design‑driven build cycles</strong
                      > Ship in tight loops—design, build, test with real users,
                      learn—so we prioritize what matters and deliver working software
                      every cycle.
                    </span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-8 max-sm:px-4 text-base/7">
                Result: faster feedback, less waste, and an MVP users love —
                validated by real usage. Expect a clickable prototype in days
                and a shippable slice in weeks, with each loop measured against
                activation, retention, and task completion. You’ll spend fewer
                hours on rework, protect budget, and build a credible story for
                customers and investors.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <MeetJosh />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
